{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. We need to get ahead of tomorrow's 0900 resupply flight. We've got four cargo lots — the battery pallet, the refrigerated clinic shipment, the generator-filter crate, and the communications-cable pallet — and four positions on the aircraft: P1 forward-left, P2 forward-right, P3 aft-left, and P4 aft-right. Before I sign the load plan, I need each of you to bring your placement constraints to the 0730 cargo huddle so we can confirm tie-down, power, clearance, and segregation requirements. Let's hear what constraints each of you is working with so we can build a solid plan."}
```

